:"Product","description":"Turn a user report into a useful product follow-up.","state":"{\n  \"feedback\": \"I cannot find the export button on mobile, but my colleague sees it on desktop.\",\n  \"plan\": \"Pro\",\n  \"export_supported_on_plan\": true,\n  \"reproduction_steps\": \"Not provided\"\n}","json":true,"questions":[{"id":"category","type":"choice","instructions":"Which category best describes this feedback?","options":[{"key":"discoverability","text":"A supported feature is difficult to find in the interface."},{"key":"missing_feature","text":"The requested capability does not exist."},{"key":"plan_limit","text":"The feature is unavailable under the stated subscription."},{"key":"performance","text":"The feature exists but responds too slowly."}],"levels":null},{"id":"next_action","type":"choice","instructions":"What should the product team do first?","options":[{"key":"request_details","text":"Ask for device, screen size and steps to reproduce the mobile interface problem."},{"key":"upsell","text":"Suggest purchasing a plan despite the feature already being included."},{"key":"close","text":"Close without investigating the reported issue."}],"levels":null}]},{"name":"Product: accessibility issue routing","category":"Product","description":"Identify the right next step for a keyboard-accessibility report.","state":"{\n  \"feedback\": \"The save button cannot be reached using Tab; it works with a mouse.\",\n  \"supported_input_methods\": [\n    \"keyboard\",\n    \"mouse\"\n  ],\n  \"reproduction\": \"confirmed\"\n}","json":true,"questions":[{"id":"category","type":"choice","instructions":"Which issue category best matches the report?","options":[{"key":"accessibility","text":"A supported input method cannot operate the control."},{"key":"performance","text":"The control operates correctly but slowly."},{"key":"new_feature","text":"The user is asking for a capability not currently supported."}],"levels":null},{"id":"action","type":"choice","instructions":"What should the team do next?","options":[{"key":"fix_keyboard","text":"Investigate focus order and keyboard operation, then verify the fix."},{"key":"document_mouse","text":"Tell users to use a mouse instead of fixing the supported keyboard path."},{"key":"close","text":"Close a confirmed issue without investigation."}],"levels":null}]},{"name":"Product: release-note inclusion","category":"Product","description":"Select user-visible changes for a concise announcement.","state":"{\n  \"change\": \"Export now preserves column order selected by the user.\",\n  \"previous_behavior\": \"Columns were alphabetized regardless of selection.\",\n  \"affected_users\": \"CSV export users\"\n}","json":true,"questions":[{"id":"announce","type":"noul","instructions":"Does this change alter user-visible behavior that is useful to mention in release notes?","options":null,"levels":null},{"id":"focus","type":"choice","instructions":"What should the note emphasize?","options":[{"key":"behavior","text":"CSV exports now keep the selected column order."},{"key":"implementation","text":"Only internal variable names, without explaining the user benefit."},{"key":"unrelated","text":"A capability unrelated to this change."}],"levels":null}]},{"name":"Product: feedback evidence strength","category":"Product","description":"Separate a repeatable usability problem from an untested hypothesis.","state":"{\n  \"claim\": \"New users cannot find account settings.\",\n  \"evidence\": [\n    \"Five observed onboarding sessions; four users failed to find settings without help.\"\n  ],\n  \"suggestion\": \"Move settings into the profile menu.\",\n  \"solution_tested\": false\n}","json":true,"questions":[{"id":"problem_supported","type":"noul","instructions":"Does the supplied evidence support investigating a discoverability problem?","options":null,"levels":null},{"id":"next_step","type":"choice","instructions":"Which step is justified before shipping the proposed solution?","options":[{"key":"test_solu